# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your real .env file to source control.
#
# Quickstart (Zero-billing prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing card required) and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Generate and copy your demo key, then create a `.env` file in this directory with:
#    GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_copied_key_here
#
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily reset limit and supports Maps JS API, Places API,
# Geocoding API, and Weather API. For Air Quality, Pollen, and Solar APIs (or production usage),
# create a Google Cloud project key at:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# and enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Geocoding API, Weather API,
# Air Quality API, Pollen API, and Solar API.

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
